loating kid  while danny shows up in dimsdale on the  fairly oddparents  the references go both ways as one  episode of danny phantom contains an  easter egg tied to timmy's favorite  intergalactic superhero  in the episode what you want dany and  tucker go to the movie theater  remember those and while they're hanging  in the theater we get a glimpse of a  crash nebula  arcade game in the background behind  them crash nebula of course is a  fictional superhero from the fairly  oddparents who has his own tv show  and apparently crash nebula is so  popular he crossed over into danny  phantom's home turf with his own arcade  game  it could be just a little inside  reference for fans of both shows but we  love the idea that both danny  and timmy watch the same tv shows well  this is gravely important  to me this next one's a bit of a mind  bender  danny phantom makes a small cameo in yet  another episode of the fairly oddparents  but this time he appears within crash  nebula the show within the show that  timmy turner can't get enough of  in the fairly oddparents episode crash  nebula we get to see the origin story  for crash nebula one of timmy's favorite  superheroes  at one point you can briefly see dany  phantom on the back of a comic book  held by spriggs be back crash nebula's  alter ego  so to recap danny phantom shows up in  dimsdale but also pops up within timmy's  favorite tv show crash nebula  which also exists in danny phantom's  universe it seems pretty safe to say  that both the fairly odd parents  and danny phantom exist in the same  universe but with all these references  back and forth and within  the real question is who's visiting  who's universe  okay who's been messing with the ghost  portal  but butch hartman also made sure to  reference nickelodeon cartoons  other than the ones with his name in the  credits the fairly oddparents also  contains easter eggs that reference  spongebob  in the episode wish fixers timmy gets  punished for making too many  bad wishes one of those bad wishes  asking for a pair of turbo cheese pants  cosmo hilariously called come on boy  squarepants  then in the episode something's fishy  timmy and his fairy godparents explore  the deep sea  and discover the lost city of atlantis  at one point the king of atlantis says  that although mostly our diet consists  of crabs  starfish and the occasional underwater  squirrel  this is a pretty clear reference to the  denzians of bikini bottom  in particular mr krabs patrick and sandy  the king then burps up what looks like a  squirrel tail we sure hoped that wasn't  sandy where do you think you're going i  was just no  you're not if you thought that was a  well-hidden easter egg just wait till  you hear about this next one  spongebob was actually referenced in  another nickelodeon show before its  first episode even aired  in the hey arnold episode weighing  harold there's a scene where arnold  walks into a comic book shop  and in the background behind him you can  see a comic book titled spongebob  to top it off another two comic books in  the background form the image of  nickelodeon's cat dog  this episode aired on april 7th 1999  almost a month before spongebob's tv  premiere in may of 1999.  that means that technically this is the  first reference to spongebob  ever made on nickelodeon oh gee mom and  dad have grounded me from watching tv  in the fairly oddparents special channel  chasers we see the show parodying  a whole host of other tv shows  everything from fat man to the jetsons  in this episode timmy's parents forbid  him from watching any television  after he tries a little too hard to  emulate his favorite series  so what does timmy do he asks his fairy  godparents for a magical remote that can  take him  inside the tv so he can experience all  of his favorite tv shows first hand his  wish ends up causing unexpected  consequences of course but we can't  really blame timmy  where can we get ourselves a remote like  that hopping 